# tally 2.1.8 R11 (item 6 of the follow-up; T's spec/g4/nb3_at): a when comparing last(stated[konto], d) with money
# types the reading in its place's unit. sw[2026-03] doesn't exist (konto's last reading before March is 100.00 PLN),
# so bank[o1]'s link is refused, and konto's reading on 2026-03-10 ends that refusal: q_konto 70.00 PLN, the gap
# refused. 2.1.8's first refcore stopped REFCORE-NOT-YET (an untyped side of the comparison).
# Re-stored at tally 2.3.1 R6 (C-13.6; L §8.4): what rests on that refused link is refused, q_obs (observed(...)
# reads the link) and q_sw (flows over March, where the missing instance's day falls); before, q_obs RUN-NONE and
# q_sw 0.00 PLN. W2b (G2's review finding 3): q_sw also lists March's `when` read, which decided sw[2026-03] doesn't
# exist and so refused the link.
# tally 2.3.1 rulings 22 (part 1, a link names): the row stands in for the tuple it names by the name alone; no link is refused, judged at a point or re-walked, and only a field read through o.fulfils reaches step 7's mark. Re-stored.
=== m.tally
model nb3
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input bank: observed
input d_sw: int
input amt: money PLN
input lim: money PLN

move sw[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_sw)
  reads konto
  when last(stated[konto], start_of(m)) < lim
  leg cash from konto to sav amount amt + bal(konto) * 0

ask q_sw: flows(sw, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-04-30)
ask q_konto: bal(konto, 2026-04-30)
ask q_obs: observed(sw[2026-03]).cash.amount
ask q_last: last(stated[konto], 2026-03-31)
ask q_led: residuals konto 2026-03

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "own"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "own"
  d_sw = 10 "plan"
  amt = 10.00 PLN "plan"
  lim = 0.00 PLN "plan"

version rd0
  cite s
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-01-02
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 end "saldo"

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[o1] = (on: 2026-03-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 10.00 PLN, fulfils: sw[2026-03]) "o1"

version rd
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 70.00 PLN at 2026-03-10 end "saldo"
=== expect
q_konto: 70.00 PLN
  anchor: konto 2026-03-10 end, stated 70.00 PLN, difference -20.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-30
q_last: 70.00 PLN
  held: stated[konto] = 70.00 PLN (rd), read for 2026-03-31
  cut 2026-06-30
q_led: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 balance: model 90.00 PLN, observed 70.00 PLN, difference -20.00 PLN
    balance konto 2026-03-10 end (anchored): booked 90.00 PLN, stated 70.00 PLN, gap -20.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-30
q_obs: 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-30
q_sw: 10.00 PLN
  held: stated[konto] = 100.00 PLN (rd0), read for 2026-02-01
  held: stated[konto] = 70.00 PLN (rd), read for 2026-04-01
  cut 2026-06-30
